#%PAM-1.0
# Installed by juliet-bootstrap (setup-fingerprint) from etc/pam/hyprlock.
#
# Password only. hyprlock reads the fingerprint itself over fprintd's D-Bus API
# (hypr/hyprlock.conf), in parallel with the password box. The stock file
# includes `login` -> system-auth, whose pam_fprintd runs BEFORE pam_unix: a
# typed password would then wait on the reader, and both would fight over the
# device. password-auth is authselect's fingerprint-free stack.
auth        include     password-auth
